{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cooking Club</strong> is a romantic comedy, slice-of-life visual novel about cooking, friendship, and finding love where you least expect it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High school can be boring\u2014especially when you\u2019re stuck in classes you hate. Looking for an escape, you stumble into the only club with an open spot: <strong>The Cooking Club.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as an excuse to skip class quickly turns into a whirlwind of sizzling dishes, new friendships, and unexpected sparks of romance. Between chopping veggies and stirring sauces, your ordinary school life becomes anything but ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cooking Club</strong> serves up a fun, choice-driven adventure filled with cute girls, delicious food, and plenty of laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romantic comedy slice-of-life story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun cooking mini-games to test your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovable characters with unique personalities and routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous art, expressive sprites, and voice acting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET THE GIRLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras/f9ea5786ad22cef927106415b17354a7.avif?t=1759957355\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540590/extras_big/f9ea5786ad22cef927106415b17354a7.webp?t=1759957355 width=1560 height=1102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 